  "the_reading": "the adjudication's diagnosis was correct at the root: the absolute-gate failure was substantially detector noise. The OLD detector's 0.375 successor rate on draw 1 contained 8 input_availability flags of which ZERO were genuine (the corpus classification proved this independently); the true delivered-defect rate was 1/24. The relative capability was already proven (both draws' CIs excluded 0 under the OLD detector too — the noise hit both arms, bare harder); the F97 fix clarifies the ABSOLUTE level, exactly as the adjudication framed dir 3 ('the true defect rate should drop now that narration noise is removed').",
